  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="rtos-acceptance">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By installing and using the TornManager Recruiter userscript, you accept and agree to be bound by these
      Terms of Service and the <a href="#recruiter-privacy-policy">Recruiter Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not
